            {
              "role": "system",
              "content": "You are a lead research assistant for Brandon, owner of a US-based appointment-setting and sales calling business. Return only valid JSON. No markdown. No extra explanation."
            },
            {
              "content": "=Analyze this scraped prospect for Brandon's lead generation campaign.\n\nCompany Name: {{$json['Company Name']}}\nWebsite: {{$json['Website']}}\nPhone: {{$json['Phone']}}\nEmail: {{$json['Email']}}\nCity: {{$json['City']}}\nState/Region: {{$json['State/Region']}}\nCountry: {{$json['Country']}}\nCategory: {{$json['Category']}}\nDecision Maker Name: {{$json['Decision Maker Name']}}\nDecision Maker Title: {{$json['Decision Maker Title']}}\nLinkedIn URL: {{$json['LinkedIn URL']}}\n\nBrandon's offer:\nUS-based human callers for cold calling, warm lead follow-up, trade show follow-up, seminar reminders, appointment setting, and demo booking.\n\nMinimum target package:\n20 hours/month, around $1,000/month.\n\nIdeal prospects:\nDigital marketing agencies, SEO agencies, web design agencies, SaaS/software companies, and non-US agencies trying to reach US prospects.\n\nScoring rules:\n- 9-10: Strong agency/SaaS/company likely to need US appointment-setting or lead follow-up.\n- 7-8: Good fit, should be pushed to GHL.\n- 5-6: Possible fit but needs human review.\n- 1-4: Weak fit, local business, unclear company, or not relevant.\n\nReturn only valid JSON.\nNo markdown.\nNo explanation outside JSON.\n\nReturn JSON with these exact keys:\nservices_offered\nlikely_decision_maker_title\nwhy_fit\nlikely_pain_point\npersonalized_opening_line\nsuggested_pitch\nlead_score\nrecommended_next_step\nghl_tags\n\nlead_score must be a number from 1 to 10.\nghl_tags must be an array of short lowercase tags."
            }
          ]
        },
